      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cedar_Hill%2C_New_Mexico"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Cedar Hill sits at 36.9369°N latitude and –107.8903°W longitude, right on the Colorado border.",
